# Feature architecture (portfolio)

## Layout

`lib/features/<feature>/`

- **`data/`** — `datasources/` (local and, for contact, `contact_remote_datasource_impl.dart`), `repositories/*_impl.dart`.
- **`domain/`** — `entities/`, `repositories/` (abstract), `usecases/` (single-purpose classes).
- **`presentation/`** — `bloc/` (`*_event.dart`, `*_state.dart`, `*_bloc.dart`), `pages/`, `widgets/`.

## Rule

Dependencies point **inward**: presentation depends on domain; data implements domain. Prefer **no** Flutter imports in `domain/` entities and use cases when practical.

## Shared UI

Cross-cutting widgets live in `lib/widgets/`, not inside a feature, when multiple sections reuse them.
